## Description

Hey everyone, Alex here 👋

Google I/O week dominated the AI world, and we went DEEP — I attended in person for the third year in a row, had breakfast with Jeff Dean, and Logan Kilpatrick from Google DeepMind joined us live to break down the launches. Plus, OpenAI quietly dropped one of the most important AI milestones ever: autonomously solving an 80-year-old open math problem.

Joining me this week: Wolfram Ravenwolf, LDJ, Nisten Tahiraj, and special guest Logan Kilpatrick (MTS, Google DeepMind).

